<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/agents/design-review-api.md/s007/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/agents/design-review-api.md/s007> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/agents/design-review-db.md/s005/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2707 ;
    djr:text "\n- 두 모드 모두 코드·명세를 수정하지 않는다(읽기 전용).\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/agents/design-review-api.md/s007/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/agents/design-review-api.md/s007> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/agents/design-review-db.md/s005/b2> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2708 ;
    djr:text "- 도메인 규칙·애그리거트 경계는 ddd 리뷰어, 저장·트랜잭션·인덱스·멱등성 저장소는 db 리뷰어의 몫 — 그쪽으로 넘기고 계약에 집중한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/agents/design-review-api.md/s007/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/agents/design-review-api.md/s007> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/agents/design-review-db.md/s005/b3> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2709 ;
    djr:text "- 스코프를 넓히는 권고를 하지 않는다 — 스코프 의문은 발견으로만 올린다.\n"@ko .
